  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The Tic Tac video is Navy footage from 2004, taken near the aircraft carrier USS Nimitz, of a white oval object shaped like the mint. One reading holds that what looks like a change in the object is really the camera zooming: Mick West, as the skeptic Michael Shermer tells Michels, pointed out that the vertical axis of the footage shows the reading \"zoom 1.0.\" If that is right, part of what looks strange in the video comes from the camera, not the object."
